<?xml version="1.0" encoding="ISO-8859-1"?>

<hotpot-jquiz-file>
<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="">
    <dc:creator>Domagoj</dc:creator>
    <dc:title>Kviz sferna zrcala</dc:title>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF><version>7</version>

<data>
<title>Kviz sferna zrcala</title>

<timer><seconds>60</seconds><include-timer>0</include-timer></timer>

<reading>
<include-reading>0</include-reading>
<reading-title></reading-title>
<reading-text></reading-text>

</reading>

<questions><question-record><question>&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122438.png&quot; alt=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122438.png&quot; title=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122438&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; height=&quot;289&quot;/&amp;#x003E;
Konkavno zrcalo se tako&amp;#x0111;er zove i:</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Divergentno zrcalo</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, divergentno zrcalo je konveksno zrcalo.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Konvergentno zrcalo</text><feedback>To&amp;#x010D;no, konkavno zrcalo fokusira svjetlost u jednoj to&amp;#x010D;ci, pa se tako&amp;#x0111;er naziva i konvergentno zrcalo.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ravno zrcalo</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, kao &amp;#x0161;to samo ime govori ravno zrcalo je ravno.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Konveksno zrcalo</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, konveksno zrcalo je zaobljeno prema van.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ispup&amp;#x010D;eno zrcalo</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, ispup&amp;#x010D;eno zrcalo je zaobljeno prema van.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122353.png&quot; alt=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122353.png&quot; title=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122353&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; height=&quot;316&quot;/&amp;#x003E;
Kakva slika &amp;#x0107;e nastati u konkavnom zrcalu ako predmet postavimo izme&amp;#x0111;u fokusa i tjemena zrcala?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Realna, obrnuta, umanjena</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, realna slika nastaje samo kada je predmet postavljen iza F</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Realna, obrnuta, uve&amp;#x0107;ana</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, realna slika nastaje samo kada je predmet postavljen iza F</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Virtualna, obrnuta i uve&amp;#x0107;ana</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, virtualna slika koja nastaje iz konkavnog zrcala je uvijek uspravna.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Virtualna, uspravna i uve&amp;#x0107;ana</text><feedback>To&amp;#x010D;no, ako postavimo predmet izme&amp;#x0111;u F i T, zrake svjetlosti divergiraju nakon refleksije i njihove &quot;ekstenzije&quot; se sijeku iza zrcala - slika je virtualna, uspravna i uve&amp;#x0107;ana.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ne&amp;#x0107;e nastati slika.</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, slika u zrcalu uvijek nastaje bila ona realna ili virtualna.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122411.png&quot; alt=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122411.png&quot; title=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122411&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; height=&quot;187&quot;/&amp;#x003E;
Konveksno zrcalo uvijek proizvodi sliku koja je:</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Virtualna, uspravna, umanjena</text><feedback>Konveksna zrcala raspr&amp;#x0161;uju svjetlost, te na&amp;#x0161; mozak predo&amp;#x0107;uje sliku koja nastaje iza zrcala - virtualna, umanjena, uspravna.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Realna, obrnuta, umanjena</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, konveksna zrcala nikad ne proizvode realne slike.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Realna, obrnuta, uve&amp;#x0107;ana</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, konveksna zrcala nikad ne proizvode realne slike.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Virtualna, uspravna, uve&amp;#x0107;ana</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, pove&amp;#x0107;anje se javlja kod konkavnih zrcala.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Virtualna, obrnuta, umanjena</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, konveksna zrcala nikad ne proizvode obrnutu sliku.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122212.png&quot; alt=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122212.png&quot; title=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 122212&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; height=&quot;268&quot;/&amp;#x003E;
&amp;#x017D;ari&amp;#x0161;na duljina sfernih zrcala je jednaka:
</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>f = R</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, ova relacija bi postavila fokus zrcala u C.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>f = 2R</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, ovo je obrnuta relacija:
R = f / 2.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>f = R / 2</text><feedback>To&amp;#x010D;no, za svako sferno zrcalo &amp;#x017E;ari&amp;#x0161;na duljina je udaljenost od T do C.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>f = r / 2</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, r je udaljenost od T do C, ne 
radijus zakrivljenosti</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>f = R / 3</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, kriva formula.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 123441.png&quot; alt=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 123441.png&quot; title=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 123441&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; height=&quot;180&quot;/&amp;#x003E;
&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 123458.png&quot; alt=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 123458.png&quot; title=&quot;Snimka zaslona 2026-05-18 123458&quot; width=&quot;400&quot; height=&quot;235&quot;/&amp;#x003E;
Ako postavimo predmet u centar zakrivljenosti C konkavnog zrcala, slika &amp;#x0107;e biti:</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Realna, obrnuta, iste veli&amp;#x010D;ine.</text><feedback>To&amp;#x010D;no, tako&amp;#x0111;er slika &amp;#x0107;e se nalaziti na centru zakrivljenosti.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ne&amp;#x0107;e nastati slika.</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, slika uvijek nastaje u zrcalima.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Realna, obrnuta, uve&amp;#x0107;ana.</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, ovo se zbiva kada je slika izme&amp;#x0111;u F i C.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Virtualna, uspravna, uve&amp;#x0107;ana.</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, slika je takva kad je predmet postavljen izme&amp;#x0111;u T i C.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Virtualna, obrnuta, umanjena</text><feedback>Neto&amp;#x010D;no, u C slika koja nastaje nije virtualna.</feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record></questions>
</data>

